 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump at a rally last night in Grand Island, Neb. Photo: Win McNamee/Getty Images 😡 California leaders are blasting President Trump after he said during a rally last night, about Iran: "Let them take out Los Angeles. Let them take out San Diego." The White House claims that Trump was talking about stopping Iran from attacking those cities. Get the latest . 👩‍💼 Sally Yates, a deputy attorney general in the Obama administration, will oversee a review into Cornell University's handling of sexual misconduct complaints. That comes amid widespread anger over how the school dealt with allegations of a 2024 gang rape at a fraternity house. Get the latest . 🍿 Paramount Skydance closed its deal to acquire Warner Bros. Discovery, ending a dramatic, yearlong process that rattled Hollywood, Wall Street and Washington. The deal creates one of the world's largest entertainment behemoths and makes CEO David Ellison one of the most powerful people in culture and business. More from Sara Fischer . 
 
